# Architecture

Pipeline: `components/*.js` (spec) → `src/core/resolve.js` (apply framework profile + project config)
→ `src/generators/*` (one output per target) → `dist/<framework>/<target>/` and `dist/gallery/`.

- `src/core/validate.js`: spec rules. Add a rule here whenever a generator would otherwise break.
- `src/core/resolve.js`: roles → classes, button class chains, motion attributes.
- `src/core/tokens.js`: design tokens; `blokset.config.js` overrides or maps them to project CSS vars.
- `src/core/css.js`: mobile-first CSS and the shared stylesheets (tokens, utilities, buttons).
- `src/generators/markup.js`: the single tree emitter used by React, Astro, vanilla and static HTML.
  Add new node features here once rather than per target.
- `src/generators/webflow.js`: `@webflow/XscpData` clipboard payload. Desktop-first breakpoints,
  combo classes as nested style records.
- `src/core/figma-style.js` and `src/generators/figma.js`: the same spec as a Figma document
  (auto-layout, variables, component properties, breakpoint variants). `src/figma-runtime/builder.js`
  is copied to `figma-plugin/code.js` and builds that document inside Figma. No import/export in that file.
- `src/runtime/motion-core.js`: behaviour runtime, embedded into an ESM build (npm gsap) and a
  global build (CDN gsap). No import/export in that file.
- `frameworks/*.js`: class-naming profiles. `_template.js` documents the shape.
- `blokset.config.js`: per-project settings (framework, tokens, utilities, button classes).

Conventions: plain ESM JavaScript with JSDoc types, Node ≥ 20, no runtime deps besides gsap.
Every change to generators must keep `npm run check` green (tests + strict tsc on React output +
Astro compile).
